{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 36,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Elihu also proceeded, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Suffer me a little, and I will show thee that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I have",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " yet to speak on God's behalf.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will bring my knowledge from afar, and will ascribe righteousness to my Maker.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For truly my words ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " false: he that is perfect in knowledge ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mighty, and despiseth not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mighty in strength ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He preserveth not the life of the wicked: but giveth right to the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He withdraweth not his eyes from the righteous: but with kings ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are they",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on the throne; yes, he doth establish them for ever, and they are exalted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bound in fetters, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " are held in cords of affliction;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then he showeth them their work, and their transgressions that they have exceeded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He openeth also their ear to discipline, and commandeth that they return from iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If they obey and serve ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", they shall spend their days in prosperity, and their years in pleasures.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if they obey not, they shall perish by the sword, and they shall die without knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the hypocrites in heart heap up wrath: they cry not when he bindeth them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They die in youth, and their life ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among the unclean.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He delivereth the poor in his affliction, and openeth their ears in oppression.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even so would he have removed thee out of the strait ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "into",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a broad place, where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no straitness; and that which should be set on thy table ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "would be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " full of fatness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou hast fulfilled the judgment of the wicked: judgment and justice take hold ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "on thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wrath, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "beware",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lest he take thee away with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " stroke: then a great ransom cannot deliver thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Will he esteem thy riches? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "no",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", not gold, nor all the forces of strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Desire not the night, when people are cut off in their place.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take heed, regard not iniquity: for this hast thou chosen rather than affliction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God exalteth by his power: who teacheth like him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who hath enjoined him his way? or who can say, Thou hast wrought iniquity?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember that thou magnify his work, which men behold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every man may see it; man may behold ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " afar off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " great, and we know ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not, neither can the number of his years be searched out.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he maketh small the drops of water: they pour down rain according to the vapor of it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which the clouds do drop ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " distill upon man abundantly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also can ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " understand the spreadings of the clouds, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the noise of his tabernacle?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, he spreadeth his light upon it, and covereth the bottom of the sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For by them he judgeth the people; he giveth food in abundance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With clouds he covereth the light; and commandeth it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "not to shine",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " intervening ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "cloud",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.36.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.36.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The noise of it showeth concerning it, the cattle also concerning the vapor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
